# Android modifications applied to the in-tree Krux.
#
# One patch per file, produced by `krux_delta.py record <ref>`.
# The reason column is documentation, not enforced.
# Format: <path under src/krux> | <why it is modified>
#
# Recorded against: krux-sighash-noknots-min

display.py | font metrics and geometry from the Kivy lcd, not board.config; portrait by default
encryption.py | mnemonic storage on kivy JsonStore; older backend than main's
krux_settings.py | no boot_flash_hash, no persist setting; no Settings singleton; orientation via Settings()
metadata.py | VERSION carries the Android marker
pages/__init__.py | base Page: no to_landscape/to_portrait, Android draw calls
pages/capture_entropy.py | no orientation calls; Shannon entropy over 24-bit
pages/datum_tool.py | clipboard instead of SD card
pages/encryption_ui.py | no StorageCorruptedError guard (older storage backend)
pages/home_pages/bip85.py | Android BIP85
pages/home_pages/home.py | board import; shutdown label via ctx.power_manager
pages/login.py | no tools page; About is text not QR; Shutdown always in menu
pages/mnemonic_loader.py | Android mnemonic entry
pages/qr_capture.py | no orientation calls; Android camera provider
pages/qr_view.py | Android QR rendering
pages/settings_page.py | Android settings page
pages/tools.py | no flash tools on Android
pages/utils.py | no LIGHT_THEME colour special case
qr.py | QR version capped at 10 for high-DPI screens
settings.py | kivy JsonStore settings backend; imports board
themes.py | Android colour set
touch.py | Android touch handling
